WEBVTT

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:03.380
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:06.270
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:12.910
I'm back.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.000
Welcome home.

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:15.910
Whoa!

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:19.310
Daily accumulation of data is the foundation of idol research.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.820
You really <i>are</i> the Idol Professor!

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:28.110
Man, Mizuki-chan's everywhere.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.380
Ichigo, look!

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.170
Why, what is it?

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:37.180
"Toudou Yurika-sama's true form is a plain old glasses girl?!"

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.130
This is a scandal!

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:40.930
A scandal?!

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:59.380
Hi, signalize!

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:04.660
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:04.660
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.550
No, that's wrong

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.550
iie chigau yo

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:11.930
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:11.930
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:01:12.310 --> 00:01:13.720
Do that signalize!

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:18.900
Something's starting to bubble up

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:18.900
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:22.860
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:22.860
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:26.400
So I'll believe in the present

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:26.400
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:31.570
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:31.570
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:32.910
Chance for me

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:38.210
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:38.210
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:42.420
It's just another challenge on the way

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:42.420
hora chousen matteru yo

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:47.340
Where are we headed?

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:47.340
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:51.090
Into a brilliant hope

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:51.090
mabushii kibou no naka e

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:58.350
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:58.350
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:01.730
Where we're headed

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:01.730
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:05.610
is into our hopes for the future

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:05.610
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:12.950
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:12.950
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:24.410
I am a descendant of the great Count Dracula who has wandered this mortal plane for six hundred years. {not that kind of plain}

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:28.920
I'm not the type of being a little girl like you can so easily talk to.

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:33.400
Or perhaps... do you want Yurika-sama 
to suck your blood that badly?

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:34.560
Aye!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.460
Knock it off.

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:39.800
Yurika-chan!

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:42.050
Why are you in such a rush?

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:44.560
Yurika-chan, this isn't good! {I hate this, can't pick something}

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.980
Oh my god! Bad news!

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:50.500
It's a scandal!

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:51.820
Are you referring to this?

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:54.460
Oh, you're aware of it, Headmistress?

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:55.130
Yes.

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:59.110
This is... bad! Bad timing!

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:03.970
The Rock Fest that Toudou Yurika is starring in is right around the corner!

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:07.830
How could there be a scandal at such an important time?

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:13.670
Scandal... the divulging of a well guarded secret.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:19.070
The truth of the vampire character 
Toudou Yurika puts on has been let out!

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:21.470
Oh no! It's a pinch! {sup star driver}

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.650
Calm down, Bepp-sensei.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:24.930
Bad! No!

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.560
Scandals are necessary for idols.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:32.500
How Toudou Yurika overcomes this test...

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:35.820
will determine her future.

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:42.070
Yurika-tan ran off without her parasol.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:44.280
It really must have hit her hard.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.330
But just when was this taken?

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:50.670
Looks like it was from when Yurika-chan went to the hospital with a cold.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.580
Ichigo-tan's in the picture too.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.020
Yeah, I was the one who took her there.

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:58.340
And here's one where she's getting her garlic ramen delivered.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:01.060
"A vampire who likes garlic ramen?"

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:02.340
And stuff like that too.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.960
Yurika-tan, gap love! {ehh, they should understand it by now.}

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:07.720
Yurika-chan's cute no matter how she looks.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:08.970
A scandal...

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.980
It's the mark of an idol.

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:16.110
Having one or two exposed makes you a true idol!

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:17.340
I didn't know that.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:19.630
I'm jealous of her.

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:21.560
No, this one is bad.

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:25.330
Yurika's fans liked her for her vampire character.

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:29.650
There are some who may leave her now that she's been exposed.

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:35.630
Plus, her Aikatsu Ranking might fall because of this as well.

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:37.390
Aikatsu Ranking?

00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:38.660
What's that?

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:40.270
You don't know?

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:41.210
Yeah...

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:48.950
Here at Starlight Academy, there's a system to determine everyone's position, the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:52.520
And the one standing at the top is none other than...

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.400
Mizuki-chan!

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:59.650
Right. We students take all sorts of auditions and compete in the rankings.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.520
The most influential audition is the Starlight Queen Cup,

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:06.660
and Mizuki-san is the reigning champion.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:10.160
Everyone is aiming to be like Mizuki-chan by increasing their own ranking.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:14.730
It's not the most important, but the Ranking is a good way of measuring popularity.

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:17.800
You get stronger by competing, and in turn build motivation.

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:18.670
Right.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:22.670
I hope Yurika doesn't lose that motivation
 thanks to this scandal though.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.300
Let's go check up on her!

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:29.740
Yeah!

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:36.390
Yurika-chan, Yurika-chan!

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:44.320
Yurika-chan, here.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.900
You wouldn't want to lose this, right?

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:51.530
Even though I was sick, 
I should've been more on my guard.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:55.330
Mizuki-chan would never let a 
picture like that be taken of her.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.430
What am I doing?!

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:00.080
This is the worst.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:06.470
Hey, Yurika-chan. Have you thought about what to wear for Rock Fest yet?

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:10.610
Then let's have a brainstorming session.

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:11.350
Aye!

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:14.720
I'd like Yurika-sama to wear something really cool!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:15.950
Yurika.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:20.720
Could we have a look?

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:23.370
Sure.

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:28.280
Yurika-chan's definitely going to want to use Loli Gothic,

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:31.980
so how about this for the top, and these for the bottom and shoes?

00:06:31.980 --> 00:06:33.790
Don't you think these shoes would work better?

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:35.880
Otome thinks that this one's the best.

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:39.540
How about going all out and using Premium Rare cards?

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.440
Premium cards!

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:44.140
But Yurika-chan doesn't have any yet, does she?

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:45.050
I don't.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:50.360
If you wear a Premium Dress to as big an event as the Rock Fest, it's sure to get people talking about you.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:51.280
I'm sure!

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:54.390
That scandal's going to just blow right over.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:55.460
That's right!

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:57.560
But there's just one problem.

00:06:57.940 --> 00:06:59.060
What is it?

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:03.190
I heard that the designer of Loli Gothic is quite the scary person.

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:06.900
I've also heard that it's not easy to get cards from him.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.520
Don't worry!

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:13.480
Yurika-chan, we'll go with you, 
so let's go meet the designer.

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.250
Let's get you some Premium cards!

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:16.400
Come on.

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:17.900
Let's go!

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:21.400
Thanks, girls. But it's alright...

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.880
I won't go to Rock Fest.

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:28.840
But why, Yurika-chan?

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:32.840
Sorry, but could you leave me alone?

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:38.350
Tomato, tomato, red red tomato!

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:42.810
Oh! Sour and sweet!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:43.850
Johnny-sensei!

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:47.230
What happened, Starmiya?

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:49.860
I want to have a meeting with Loli Gothic's designer!

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:54.810
I <i>need</i> to get Premium Rare cards no matter what!

00:07:55.870 --> 00:08:00.370
Terrible, dangerous... ghost horror!

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:01.930
No!

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:03.330
Johnny-sensei!

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:06.290
Suzukawa-san.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.550
What're you doing?

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:15.550
Why do you need to get your hands 
on Loli Gothic Premium Rare cards?

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:20.430
If we had those cards, I'm sure 
Yurika-chan would go back to normal.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:21.810
That's wrong.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:27.310
If she doesn't have the desire, then even <i>with</i> the cards nothing will change.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:29.190
Isn't that right?

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:38.010
Yeah... you're right.

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:50.380
Sorry, Yurika-chan! But I want you to
 come and suck my blood again!

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:54.010
Uh, I mean... well...

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:56.810
I want you to go back to the usual Yurika-sama!

00:08:56.810 --> 00:09:00.400
I'm certain your fans all feel the same way too.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:04.390
My fans...

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:08.400
They supported my vampire character.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:12.650
But then I let them see me in such a state—I disappointed them.

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:16.880
I'm going to be quit being an idol!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:18.910
You can't!

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:24.300
Come on.

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:27.410
Hey, where are you taking me?

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:29.540
Look!

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.370
It's Yurika-sama!

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:33.860
Yurika-sama's arrived!

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:35.050
She's here!

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:38.970
Everyone's been waiting for you.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:39.550
Huh?

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.890
Oh, it's just you, Ichigo-chan. That surprised me.

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:49.210
Wh-What are you doing?

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:51.760
We're fans of Yurika-sama.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:56.840
Fans?

00:09:56.840 --> 00:10:01.690
Yeah. You know how Yurika-sama prowls for her prey here every night, right?

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:04.080
We're waiting to catch a glimpse of her.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.570
But right now, Yurika-chan's...

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:08.970
I'm sure she'll come back to us.

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:09.820
Yeah.

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:13.500
Everyone believes in Yurika-sama.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:15.390
Ichigo-chan.

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:16.090
Yes?

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:20.850
I want to see my fans once more.

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:22.860
Yeah, let's go meet them.

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:24.920
But if I'm like this...

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:27.360
That's right.

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:32.360
I'm going to have a meeting with Loli Gothic's designer!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.860
I'm going to get myself Premium Rare cards!

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:36.640
Yeah!

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:43.620
Hello... ah, Headmistress!

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.930
I managed to schedule a meeting 
with Loli Gothic's designer.

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:50.310
Tell Toudou Yurika that she's free 
to go when she feels better.

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:03.800
This is... where Loli Gothic's designer lives?

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:06.040
Yeah, Yumekouji Maya-san.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:08.040
Are we <i>really</i> still in Japan?

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.100
It's lovely!

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:22.810
Let's go.

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:23.710
Okay.

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:30.370
Alan, it seems that we have visitors.

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:56.590
That scared me!

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:59.060
So this is what they meant by scary...

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:02.190
L-Let's get a move on and leave right after we get the Premium Rare cards.

00:12:02.190 --> 00:12:04.910
Everyone, sorry for dragging you along.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:07.280
I don't know what you mean. Let's move!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.600
O-Otome-chan?

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:14.750
It's a lovely kitty kyat!

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:22.130
No, still not right.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.880
One more try!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:26.930
You've been there once before too, if I recall correctly.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:29.930
Yes...

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:35.450
I'll never forget that fearful day I went to deliver a gift...

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:38.000
It was like a bad dream! Truly a nightmare.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:42.400
That was just Maya's form of hospitality.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:46.430
Hospitality? Hiring part-timers, building a haunted house,

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:49.660
and scaring everyone that walks in is too much!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:51.990
True, he does overdo it.

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:57.300
But it's more than his personal touch of 
entertainment—it's also to test the idols.

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:58.170
What?

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:03.570
He tests their feelings towards Loli Gothic, as well as their strong resolution to becoming idols.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:07.390
Yumekouji Maya will only meet 
with those who pass those trials.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:12.220
Does Toudou Yurika have it in her to get to Maya?

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:23.690
Ran, you're so cool!

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:25.610
Here.

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:27.650
Whoa, it's Shibuki Ran-chan!

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:28.990
I'm a fan of yours!

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:31.990
I'm so happy!

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:35.050
You can get there faster if you turn at the next corner.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.710
Th-Thank you.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.220
This way, everyone.

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:40.940
Thank you very much!

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:46.130
They've passed the first checkpoint!

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:47.630
I see...

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:57.640
They're here.

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:00.430
Leave!

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:04.990
Go home!

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:04.990
Leave this place!

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:10.330
You don't have the right to wear Loli Gothic!

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:14.910
You aren't worthy of using Loli Gothic cards!

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:17.070
Go home!

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:18.410
Yurika-chan!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.790
Let's hurry up and find Yumekouji Maya!

00:14:27.390 --> 00:14:28.550
Yurika!

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:30.610
Leave this place to us.

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:32.550
You go on ahead.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:39.310
Oh my, what scrumptious visitors we have today.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.460
Yurika-chan, go!

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:44.070
Go get your Premium Dress!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.070
But...

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:46.440
Your fans are waiting.

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.610
Hey, come back!

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:49.610
Thanks!

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:01.460
You're the first to have made it this far.

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:06.870
I have possessed this mansion 
for the last three hundred years.

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:11.260
This isn't a place for little girls like 
you to wander about as you please.

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:13.250
Yurika-chan.

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:14.350
What <i>is</i> this?

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:17.210
Quiet yourselves!

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:22.640
Do you all want Yurika-sama to suck your blood that badly?

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:26.020
Yurika-chan!

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:31.620
You. It's far too early to think your 
three hundred years can match me.

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:36.120
I'm a descendant of the great Count Dracula who has lived for over six hundred years.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:39.120
This Yurika-sama came out of her way to meet you.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.670
I'll be taking my Premium Rare cards now.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.340
Interesting.

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:47.170
Then I suppose I should prepare a fitting entertainment for one such as yourself.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.130
You're...

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:52.620
Nice to meet you. I'm Yumekouji Maya.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:16:00.180
A Loli Gothic Premium Dress.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:03.710
My masterpiece, the Goth Magic Coord. {magick?}

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:05.310
Goth Magic Coord...

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.320
It's beautiful...

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:11.080
Do you believe you are fit to wear this dress?

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:11.950
Huh?

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:16.160
The dresses I make suit only strong girls.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:20.000
Those who are resolute, dignified, 
and always looking straight ahead.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:27.540
I won't let a girl who loses her wits just from a picture like this wear my dresses.

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:31.300
Maya-san! Yurika-chan hasn't lost her wits from—

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:40.810
I... I want to wear your Premium Dress.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:45.650
Once I wear it, I'm sure I'll get the courage to stand in front of my fans once more.

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:47.920
So please...

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:50.400
Please give me your Goth Magic Coord!

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:55.660
Designers put their heart and souls into making their clothes. Therefore...

00:16:56.030 --> 00:17:00.010
All of them share a wish for those clothes to be worn by someone worthy.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:06.280
Can you proudly say that you are 
worthy of this dress as you are now?

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:08.420
I cannot.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.050
Yurika-chan.

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:14.300
But I... I love Loli Gothic dresses.

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:19.480
I may not be worthy of wearing a 
Premium Rare Dress right now.

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:21.250
But one day I will be!

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:23.270
I'll do everything I can to make myself worthy!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:28.060
I'll become an idol more worthy than anyone else to wear that Loli Gothic Dress!

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:41.080
If you continue to advance with 
your eyes set on such a lofty goal,

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:44.000
then one day you may finally reach it.

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:58.960
I like girls who show effort, like you.

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:01.470
This dress will surely suit you.

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:07.520
Isn't that obvious? Who else besides Yurika-sama could possibly make this dress look good?

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:18.030
And finally, the day of Rock Fest was upon us.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:23.540
Galaxy! Amazing! It's tomato juice!

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:27.050
This is my painstakingly formulated 
Johnny Special just for today.

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:28.120
Sensei...

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:31.790
Drink this and think "Girls be Vampire"! {thanks Japanese}

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:32.690
Got it!

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.300
It's great!

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.300
Of course, that's obvious.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:43.810
It's about time.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:45.560
Here I go!

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.060
You can do it!

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:51.980
Yurika-sama!

00:21:51.980 --> 00:21:54.400
Your Premium Rare Dress was the best!

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:57.210
But you were cute in your glasses too, Yurika-sama.

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:58.960
Yeah, I want to see that again!

00:21:59.390 --> 00:22:03.670
That was a super rare Yurika-sama seen only once every three hundred years.

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:05.320
How fortunate for you.

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:11.240
Do you all want Yurika-sama to suck your blood that badly?

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:14.080
Looks like she overcame it.

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:16.200
All her fans are having fun too!

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:18.710
But in the end, <i>that's</i> gotta be the real Yurika-chan.

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:20.860
Yurika-sama...

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:22.650
...has been resurrected!

00:23:55.590 --> 00:23:57.700
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.540 --> 00:24:01.270
I didn't realize my picture was taken at all.

00:24:01.270 --> 00:24:03.820
I need to be careful not to let my secret out too.

00:24:03.820 --> 00:24:05.300
You have a secret?

00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:06.590
I guess not.

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:09.800
The walls have ears, the doors have eyes.

00:24:10.580 --> 00:24:13.010
That legendary drama's coming back!

00:24:13.010 --> 00:24:15.260
Yeah! There's an audition for a new role! {Can't hear what they're saying clearly}

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:18.010
It's no time to sit around, this's a big chance!

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:19.350
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.350 --> 00:24:21.470
Stylish Thief☆Swallowtail.

00:24:21.470 --> 00:24:23.800
Always passionate, Idol Activities! {woo, it's masquerade!}
